This project is an independent Go reimplementation of memex
(https://github.com/iamtouchskyer/memex, npm `@touchskyer/memex`),
Copyright (c) 2026 iamtouchskyer, which is also MIT licensed. The Go source is
written from scratch; it targets compatibility with upstream's on-disk card
format and MCP / CLI surface.

The files under `skills/` are derived from upstream's `skills/` directory
(`memex-sync/SKILL.md` verbatim, the other four adapted). Upstream's copyright
notice is retained in LICENSE for that reason.
